# []N_GRID draws numbers; characters are a type error (QD8).
== SOURCE
([]S_CALE 1) []N_GRID "ab"
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected a number, found Char
 --> -e:1:2
  |
1 | ([]S_CALE 1) []N_GRID "ab"
  |  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |  ---------- `[]S_CALE` always gives a Scale
  |                       ---- a string: a vector of Char
  = note: `[]N_GRID` has type Num a => Scale -> a -> Char
  = help: a string is text, not a number: write a number without quotes
